<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hooper Holmes.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hooper Holmes.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it upgraded Hooper Holmes Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hooper Holmes remained unchanged at 16-1/4.</p>
